Homepage: https://github.com/SujayPro/EnderDesk
Description: EnderGram - fast, low-memory Telegram desktop client
 EnderGram is a Telegram-compatible desktop client for Linux with ghost mode,
 saved message history, message filters, built-in translation, streamer mode
 and deep customisation. This package ships the native EnderGram launcher and
 engine, desktop integration, icons and the Noir and Frost themes. The default
 launch profile targets about 250 MB RSS and uses XWayland raster rendering;
 --gpu restores hardware acceleration.
